  "notes": "TYPES OF {監査|かんさ}:\n- {外部監査|がいぶかんさ}: external audit\n- {内部監査|ないぶかんさ}: internal audit\n- {会計監査|かいけいかんさ}: financial/accounting audit\n- {業務監査|ぎょうむかんさ}: operational audit\n\nRELATED TERMS:\n- {監査役|かんさやく}: auditor (corporate)\n- {監査法人|かんさほうじん}: audit firm\n- {監査報告書|かんさほうこくしょ}: audit report\n- {公認会計士|こうにんかいけいし}: certified public accountant\n\nCORPORATE GOVERNANCE:\nIn Japanese companies, {監査役|かんさやく} plays an important role in corporate governance, distinct from the board of directors.",
